      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New in 0.1.0</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Improve any selected text anywhere on your Mac with a Hyper + A hot key</li>
          <li>Popover anchors to the selected text itself using the Accessibility API</li>
          <li>Responses stream in from your own Cloudflare AI Gateway, so provider keys never touch the app</li>
          <li>Eight models across OpenAI, Anthropic and Google</li>
          <li>Copy, paste straight back into the source app, or regenerate</li>
